From 6e8887cd8d81dade1a838c09afb25cb0f48699e7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus Developer <dev@lotus.org>
Date: Thu, 16 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] script: add sharded TLS sigcache and batch Schnorr
 verification

Optimize signature and script verification throughput by introducing a 16-shard
cuckoo signature cache (`SignatureCache`) with thread-local lookaside caching
and batch Schnorr signature verification (`BatchVerifySchnorr` / `CheckInputsBatch`)
across parallel script check worker threads.
